  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#35·28",
      "text": "This chocolate brown midi dress features a relaxed V-neckline and a tiered silhouette that flares gently from the knee. The all-over light blue floral pattern adds texture without overwhelming your figure, while the sleeveless cut keeps you cool during warm summer evenings."
    },
    {
      "n": "#196·04",
      "text": "Crafted in soft taupe leather, these block-heel loafers offer a wide square toe and a stable, geometric heel perfect for walking all day. Their slip-on design makes them effortless to wear with your dress, providing comfort without sacrificing polish."
    },
    {
      "n": "#489·37",
      "text": "A smooth, rich ginger belt with a polished silver buckle sits at your waist to define your silhouette. Its medium width and simple loop design keep the focus on your natural shape rather than adding unnecessary detail."
    },
    {
      "n": "#26·38",
      "text": "This vibrant burgundy crossbody bag features an abstract tapestry of colorful geometric shapes framed by a solid leather flap. Its adjustable strap allows you to wear it across your body for hands-free convenience, while the deep red tone pairs beautifully with your warm-toned dress."
    }
  ]
}
